  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/server-server-api/#put_matrixfederationv2send_joinroomideventid\r\n\r\nThe join event only needs a signature from a resident server if joining via the restricted join rules flow, i.e. `join_authorised_via_users_server` is specified. \r\n\r\nc.f. [MSC3083](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/blob/main/proposals/3083-restricted-rooms.md) and [Room Version 8 auth rules](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/rooms/v8/) \r\n",
